{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1872","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"C. Non-coprime Split"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"1 second"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You are given two integers $$$l \\le r$$$. You need to find "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"positive"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" integers $$$a$$$ and $$$b$$$ such that the following conditions are simultaneously satisfied:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$l \\le a + b \\le r$$$"}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$\\gcd(a, b) \\neq 1$$$"}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"or report that they do not exist."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"$$$\\gcd(a, b)$$$ denotes the "},{"attrs":{"href":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Greatest_common_divisor"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"greatest common divisor"}],"kind":"link"},{"kind":"text","text":" of numbers $$$a$$$ and $$$b$$$. For example, $$$\\gcd(6, 9) = 3$$$, $$$\\gcd(8, 9) = 1$$$, $$$\\gcd(4, 2) = 2$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line of the input contains an integer $$$t$$$ ($$$1 \\le t \\le 500$$$) — the number of test cases."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Then the descriptions of the test cases follow."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The only line of the description of each test case contains $$$2$$$ integers $$$l, r$$$ ($$$1 \\le l \\le r \\le 10^7$$$)."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For each test case, output the integers $$$a, b$$$ that satisfy all the conditions on a separate line. If there is no answer, instead output a single number $$$-1$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"If there are multiple answers, you can output any of them."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Example"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n11\n11 15\n1 3\n18 19\n41 43\n777 777\n8000000 10000000\n2000 2023\n1791791 1791791\n1 4\n2 3\n9840769 9840769\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n6 9\n-1\n14 4\n36 6\n111 666\n4000000 5000000 \n2009 7\n-1\n2 2\n-1\n6274 9834495"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the first test case, $$$11 \\le 6 + 9 \\le 15$$$, $$$\\gcd(6, 9) = 3$$$, and all conditions are satisfied. Note that this is not the only possible answer, for example, $$$\\{4, 10\\}, \\{5, 10\\}, \\{6, 6\\}$$$ are also valid answers for this test case."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the second test case, the only pairs $$$\\{a, b\\}$$$ that satisfy the condition $$$1 \\le a + b \\le 3$$$ are $$$\\{1, 1\\}, \\{1, 2\\}, \\{2, 1\\}$$$, but in each of these pairs $$$\\gcd(a, b)$$$ equals $$$1$$$, so there is no answer."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the third sample test, $$$\\gcd(14, 4) = 2$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"C","problemCode":"1872C","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/1872/problem/C"}